      "type": "GeneralText",
      "area": "General",
      "position": 5,
      "content": "The following ADTs are approved transfer pathways for this major: AS-T in Film, Television and Electronic Media Visit SF State ADT Pathways and Roadmaps for a list of all approved ADT pathways for SF State degree programs and to view sample post-transfer advising roadmaps for each pathway. Students preparing to transfer into this major at SF State should complete any available articulated courses in the Requirement section(s) below. Completion of the American Institutions requirement (US-1, US-2, US-3) before transfer is also strongly recommended.",
      "contentHtml": "<p>The following ADTs are approved transfer pathways for this major:</p><p>AS-T in Film, Television and Electronic Media</p><p><br></p><p>Visit <a href=\"https://ueap.sfsu.edu/2025-2026_ADT-pathways-roadmaps\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">SF State ADT Pathways and Roadmaps</a> for a list of all approved ADT pathways for SF State degree programs and to view sample post-transfer advising roadmaps for each pathway.</p><p><br></p><p>Students preparing to transfer into this major at SF State should complete any available articulated courses in the Requirement section(s) below. Completion of the American Institutions requirement (US-1, US-2, US-3) before transfer is also strongly recommended.</p>"
